 of payment to the payment of any present or future claims of (x) depositors of the Issuer, (y) other unsubordinated creditors of the Issuer (including senior non - preferred instruments ( strumenti di debito chirografario di secondo livello )), and (z) subordinated creditors of the Issuer in respect of Subordinated Indebtedness (other than Parity Securities and Junior Securities) including, without limitation, any subordinated notes qualifying as or intended to qualify as Tier 2 Capital and any subordinated instruments that have ceased to qualify, in their entirety, as own fund items ( elementi di fondi propri); (B) if and when the Notes cease to qualify, in their entirety, as Additional Tier 1 Capital and for so long as they qualify, in whole or in part, as Tier 2 Capital: (i) pari passu with payments to: ( x) holders of present or future outstanding Tier 2 Capital of the Issuer, save to the extent any such subordinated obligation rank, or are expressed to rank, senior or junior to the Notes; and (y) any securities or other obligations of the Issuer which rank, or are expressed to rank, on a vol untary or involuntary liquidation or bankruptcy of the Issuer, pari passu with Tier 2 Capital; (ii) in priority to payments to holders of present or future outstanding Junior Securities of the Issuer and any Additional Tier 1 Capital; (iii) junior in right of payment to the payment of any present or future claims of (x) depositors of the Issuer, (y) other unsubordinated creditors of the Issuer (including senior non - preferred instruments ( strumenti di debito chirografario di secondo livello )), and (z) creditors of the Issuer in respect of Subordinated Indebtedness which rank, or are expressed to rank, senior to Tier 2 Capital (including any subordinated instruments that have ceased to qualify, in their entirety, as own fund items (elementi di fondi propri)); (C) if and when the Notes do not qualify (or cease to qualify) in their entirety as Additional Tier 1 Capital and